msgstr "Beispiel 1: Einfache Kostenfunktion {#example-1-simple-cost-function}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Consider the cost function in spin formulation:\n"
"$$\n"
"C(x_0, ..., x_6) = 3 + x_0 - x_1 + 2x_2 + x_3 - 2x_4 + x_5 - x_6 + 2x_0x_1 - x_1x_2\n"
"$$\n"
