"Betrachte die Kostenfunktion in Spin-Formulierung:\n"
"$$\n"
"C(x_0, ..., x_6) = 3 + x_0 - x_1 + 2x_2 + x_3 - 2x_4 + x_5 - x_6 + 2x_0x_1 - x_1x_2\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $(x_0, ..., x_6) \\in \\{-1, 1\\}^7$.\n"
msgstr "where $(x_0, ..., x_6) \\in \\{-1, 1\\}^7$.\n"

